Look at this!

1664
00:57:42,614 --> 00:57:44,114
かなり頑張り道。
It's putting in serious effort.

1665
00:57:43,714 --> 00:57:45,414
でもー…
But...

1666
00:57:45,414 --> 00:57:49,314
