...through the mountains.

1669
00:57:51,674 --> 00:57:52,874
頑張り山道。
A hardworking mountain pass.

1670
00:57:52,874 --> 00:57:54,514
酷道みある道だな。
It definitely gives off brutal road vibes.

1671
00:57:54,814 --> 00:57:56,514
そして、403号！
And next, Route 403!

1672
00:57:56,514 --> 00:57:57,514
3！
3!

1673
00:57:57,874 --> 00:58:01,114
これも、まっすぐ目な道。新潟から長野。
This is also a fairly straight road. Niigata to Nagano.

1674
00:58:01,714 --> 00:58:02,914
うんうんうんうん。
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

1675
00:58:02,914 --> 00:58:06,114
でも、な、長野から行くのちょっと大変そうだな。まっすぐ目だけど…
Though heading out from Nagano looks a bit tough. Even if it's relatively straight...

1676
00:58:05,914 --> 00:58:08,314
結構これもしんどそうな道な予感。
...I get the feeling this is another exhausting road.

1677
00:58:07,714 --> 00:58:08,914
確かに。うん。
True. Yeah.

1678
00:58:09,244 --> 00:58:10,314
そして…
And next...

1679
00:58:10,044 --> 00:58:10,974
そして？
And?

1680
00:58:11,114 --> 00:58:12,874
345号！
Route 345!

1681
00:58:12,914 --> 00:58:15,514
あ、これは見たやつ？さっき見たやつ。日本…
Oh, is this one we've seen? The one we saw earlier. The Sea of Japan...

1682
00:58:14,674 --> 00:58:16,414
あ、道、日本海側な予感。
Ah, feels like the Sea of Japan coast.

1683
00:58:16,314 --> 00:58:17,514
日本海側ね。
Sea of Japan side, yeah.

1684
00:58:17,514 --> 00:58:20,514
日本海側の景色綺麗そうみたいな話をした予感。
I think we talked about how pretty the scenery would be along the Sea of Japan.

1685
00:58:19,974 --> 00:58:21,114
はいはいはい。
Right, right, right.

1686
00:58:21,114 --> 00:58:22,774
そして、あ！キリがいい！
And, oh! A nice round number!

1687
00:58:22,614 --> 00:58:25,214
200！キリ番きたー！
200! A nice milestone number!

1688
00:58:23,414 --> 00:58:24,714
200！キリのいい…
200! A round...

1689
00:58:25,914 --> 00:58:27,374
これは短めかも。
This one might be on the shorter side.

1690
00:58:27,174 --> 00:58:28,914
