んで、こちら！
And next up!

1702
00:58:46,114 --> 00:58:47,114
よいしょ。
Here we go.

1703
00:58:47,714 --> 00:58:48,874
あ、これも…
Oh, this one too...

1704
00:58:48,774 --> 00:58:49,774
お、岩手。
Oh, Iwate.

1705
00:58:49,514 --> 00:58:51,244
岩手だけで完結するな。
It's contained entirely within Iwate.

1706
00:58:51,244 --> 00:58:54,514
おー。でも岩手もね、広いというかデカいからね、面積。
Ooh. But Iwate is so spacious and massive in land area.

1707
00:58:51,914 --> 00:58:53,414
向きがこちら。
It's oriented this way.

1708
00:58:55,314 --> 00:58:57,914
岩手の海側から内陸に入ってく感じかの。
Looks like it goes from Iwate's coast into the interior.

1709
00:58:57,514 --> 00:58:59,474
うわー、大変そう。
Whoa, looks tough.

1710
00:58:59,314 --> 00:59:00,514
うんうんうん。
Yeah, yeah.

1711
00:59:00,514 --> 00:59:01,914
はいはいはい。
Right, right, right.

1712
00:59:01,914 --> 00:59:02,974
なかなか…
Quite a...

1713
00:59:03,514 --> 00:59:05,714
走り甲斐のありそうな…
...rewarding drive kind of...

1714
00:59:05,714 --> 00:59:07,014
道。
...road.

1715
00:59:06,874 --> 00:59:08,014
道だね。
Sure is.

1716
00:59:08,014 --> 00:59:11,714
そして、このパックの最後のカードがこちら、466号。
And the final card of this pack is this one: Route 466.

1717
00:59:11,414 --> 00:59:12,874
短い！18km！
It's short! 18 km!

1718
00:59:11,914 --> 00:59:14,114
おー、短い！18km！
Oh, that is short! 18 km!

1719
00:59:14,114 --> 00:59:14,914
うん。
Yep.

1720
00:59:14,914 --> 00:59:16,714
お、世田谷区から…
Oh, from Setagaya Ward...

1721
00:59:16,814 --> 00:59:17,874
神奈川。
Kanagawa.

1722
00:59:17,874 --> 00:59:20,244
えー、横浜保土ケ谷区の、
Um, to Hodogaya Ward in Yokohama...

1723
00:59:19,914 --> 00:59:20,914
うんうん。
Yeah, yeah.

1724
00:59:20,244 --> 00:59:21,414
18km。
...18 km.

1725
00:59:21,414 --> 00:59:24,974
お、結構じゃあ最近目なのか？割と。466。
Oh, is it a relatively newer designation then? Route 466.

1726
00:59:24,914 --> 00:59:25,914
確かにな。
True.

1727
00:59:25,914 --> 00:59:28,774
ねえ、最近目じゃし、まっすぐじゃし、すごい整備されている…
Yeah, it's pretty recent, straight, and well-maintained...

1728
00:59:28,474 --> 00:59:29,474
うん。
Yeah.

1729
00:59:29,474 --> 00:59:30,914
…通りやすそうな道。
...looks like an easy road to drive.

1730
00:59:30,914 --> 00:59:32,314
ねえ。通りやすそう。
Right. It seems very easy to drive.

1731
00:59:32,314 --> 00:59:36,114
やっぱ山道を見た後じゃとね、こういう道に安心するかも。
After looking at mountain passes, a road like this feels so reassuring.

1732
00:59:36,114 --> 00:59:38,914
