Indeed. There are urban national highways too.

1733
00:59:37,414 --> 00:59:39,514
うん。うんうんうん。
Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

1734
00:59:40,314 --> 00:59:42,914
よいしょ。じゃあ…
All right. Well then...

1735
00:59:43,314 --> 00:59:46,674
じゃあ、もう、あ、もう1時間やってますけれど。
Well, ah, we've already been going for an hour, though.

1736
00:59:46,674 --> 00:59:47,714
のじゃ！
Indeed-noja!

1737
00:59:47,714 --> 00:59:49,214
え、じゃあスーパーレア…
So, how about a Super Rare...

1738
00:59:48,814 --> 00:59:49,914
ほしい！
I want one!

1739
00:59:49,214 --> 00:59:51,244
スーパーレアほしいなー！
I really want a Super Rare~!

1740
00:59:50,614 --> 00:59:52,114
ほしいのじゃ！
I want one-noja!

1741
00:59:51,414 --> 00:59:55,314
ほしいなー、ほしいな、2のスーパーレアほしいなー！
I want one, I want one, I want a Super Rare from Pack 2~!

1742
00:59:55,314 --> 00:59:56,914
ほしいな…
I want one...

1743
00:59:56,514 --> 00:59:58,614
ちょっと開けてもらって…
Go ahead and open it for us...

1744
00:59:57,914 --> 00:59:59,874
