True! It'd be so hype if it came out of this!

1762
01:00:27,462 --> 01:00:30,462
チラ見して大丈夫？
Are you sure it's okay to peek?

1763
01:00:30,662 --> 01:00:32,962
笑ってええなどこかで
Feel free to laugh at me somewhere.

1764
01:00:33,462 --> 01:00:34,962
大丈夫？
Are you sure?

1765
01:00:34,762 --> 01:00:36,462
そうせぬのじゃ
I won't do that.

1766
01:00:38,462 --> 01:00:39,962
え、コンボパックに入ってないんだっけ？
Wait, wasn't it included in the combo pack?

1767
01:00:39,962 --> 01:00:41,962
コンボパックには入ってないのよ
It's not in the combo pack.

1768
01:00:41,962 --> 01:00:43,962
そう、このランダムのものにしか...
Right, only in these random packs...

1769
01:00:42,962 --> 01:00:45,462
そう、ランダムにしか入ってない、スーパーレアが
Yeah, the Super Rare is only in the random ones.

1770
01:00:45,462 --> 01:00:47,462
すごいよ。でも1で出たから
That's incredible. But since we got one in Pack 1...

1771
01:00:47,462 --> 01:00:48,162
うん
Yeah.

1772
01:00:48,162 --> 01:00:49,962
じゃあこれ最後見よう。はい
Let's check this last one. Here.

1773
01:00:49,962 --> 01:00:50,962
はい
Okay.

1774
01:00:51,462 --> 01:00:52,962
最後はこちら！
Here's the last one!

1775
01:00:52,962 --> 01:00:53,962
いくぞ！
Let's go!

1776
01:00:53,762 --> 01:00:54,662
のじゃ
Noja!

1777
01:00:54,462 --> 01:00:56,262
え、293号
Route 293.

1778
01:00:55,962 --> 01:00:57,462
茨城から...
From Ibaraki to...

1779
01:00:56,962 --> 01:00:58,262
茨城から栃木
Ibaraki to Tochigi.

1780
01:00:57,762 --> 01:00:58,962
栃木
Tochigi.

1781
01:00:58,962 --> 01:00:59,962
ふむふむふむ
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

1782
01:00:59,962 --> 01:01:02,962
こっちが北じゃから、東、西...
This way is north, so east to west...

1783
01:01:02,462 --> 01:01:03,962
はいはいはい
Right, right, right.

1784
01:01:03,962 --> 01:01:04,962
逆へ
In reverse.

1785
01:01:04,962 --> 01:01:06,262
逆へ
In reverse.

1786
01:01:06,262 --> 01:01:07,462
逆へ
In reverse.

1787
