そして、えーこっちが北かな？362号って、えーと愛知から静岡
And... is this way north? Route 362 goes from Aichi to Shizuoka.

1788
01:01:12,962 --> 01:01:14,162
おおー
Ooh.

1789
01:01:14,162 --> 01:01:16,162
結構...
Quite...

1790
01:01:14,462 --> 01:01:18,462
これも...静岡じゃから山？いや...
Is this one... since it's Shizuoka, mountains? No...

1791
01:01:16,762 --> 01:01:18,162
山？
Mountains?

1792
01:01:18,962 --> 01:01:22,462
静岡のこのへん...行けないか、ダメか
Around here in Shizuoka... can't it pass through? No good?

1793
01:01:22,462 --> 01:01:23,462
山...
Mountains...

1794
01:01:23,462 --> 01:01:24,962
まだ平地？
Still flat ground?

1795
01:01:24,462 --> 01:01:25,962
山の手前ぐらいか？
Around the foot of the mountains?

1796
01:01:25,962 --> 01:01:27,962
どうじゃろ、なんか行けそうな予感
I wonder. I feel like it could make it.

1797
01:01:27,962 --> 01:01:28,962
行けそう？
Could it?

1798
01:01:28,962 --> 01:01:31,462
わしこの辺の山あんま詳しくないんじゃっけと
I don't know the mountains around here too well, but...

1799
